# `Samen.AI.Embeddings.embed_field/6` no longer runs `assert_not_cross_run/1`, so a fold
# summary's embedding call reaches pgvector unblocked and the vector LANDS. This is the
# sabotage ADR-048 §8 P12 names in its own words: "remove the call-site refusal and let a
